concept:war-crimes-act-1945-sec-3a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3A Application of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3a ;
    values:originalText "Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code applies to all offences against this Act. Note: Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code sets out the general principles of criminal responsibility.   Interpretation  Part II  Section 4  War Crimes Act 1945 Compilation date: 23/5/18 Registered: 30/5/18" ;
