    skos:prefLabel "6(6) Serious crimes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-6-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of subsections (3), (4) and (5), the fact that the doing of an act was required or permitted by the law in force when and where the act was done shall be disregarded." ;
    skos:definition "(6) For the purposes of subsections (3), (4) and (5), the fact that the doing of an act was required or permitted by the law in force when and where the act was done shall be disregarded."@en ;
