concept:war-crimes-act-1945-sec-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 Effect of sections 6 and 7"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subsection 7(2), nothing in section 6 or 7 limits the generality of anything else in that section.   Interpretation  Part II  Section 8  War Crimes Act 1945 Compilation date: 23/5/18 Registered: 30/5/18  (2) An act may be a serious crime by virtue of one of more of subsections 6(1), (3), (4) and (5), but not otherwise.  (3) A serious crime may be a war crime by virtue of either or both of subsections 7(1) and (3), but not otherwise.  (4) Two or more serious crimes may together constitute a war crime by virtue of subsection 7(4), but not otherwise." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to subsection 7(2), nothing in section 6 or 7 limits the generality of anything else in that section.   Interpretation  Part II  Section 8  War Crimes Act 1945 Compilation date: 23/5/18 Registered: 30/5/18  (2) An act may be a serious crime by virtue of one of more of subsections 6(1), (3), (4) and (5), but not otherwise.  (3) A serious crime may be a war crime by virtue of either or both of subsections 7(1) and (3), but not otherwise.  (4) Two or more serious crimes may together constitute a war crime by virtue of subsection 7(4), but not otherwise."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b18706df20b4d804d1d07dbd2eb5f1bb85735fffbcadd0978bccba06828f3c73" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:war-crimes-act-1945-sec-8-ss-1 ;
