    skos:definition "(5) However, if there is such evidence, the onus of establishing, beyond a reasonable doubt, that those facts either do not exist or do not constitute the defence lies on the prosecution."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b6e4b03407ee555eb5ee1a2beb1c6e9d90c6bb25369647859c09f7da2fde809d" ;
