doc:sec-17-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "17(5) Defence based on laws, customs and usages of war" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) However, if there is such evidence, the onus of establishing, beyond a reasonable doubt, that those facts either do not exist or do not constitute the defence lies on the prosecution." ;
